<p>Hai shor abbas aa rahe hai</p>

<p>Nashaane ahmad mitaane waale, buhjhe charaagho'n ka noor dekhei'n<br />
Inhi'n charaagho'n se lau lagaakar, charaaghe dee'n jag maga raha hai</p>

<p>Habeebo muslim ke tewaro me, machal rahi hai nayi jawaani<br />
ilaahi maidaane karbala me, shabaab kis kis pa aa raha hai</p>

<p>Kisi bashar me kahaa'n ye khudrat, ye zulm seh kar kare ye himmat<br />
zayeef tooti kamar ke kas kar, jawaa'n ka lasha utha raha hai</p>

<p>Yazeediyat ka nashaan barham, hussainiyat ka buland parcham<br />
gira raha tha jise zamaana, use do aalam utha raha hai</p>

<p>Yahi nateeja hai har bala ka, Yahi khulaasa hai karbala ka<br />
Jo jee raha tha wo mar raha hai, Jo mar raha tha wo jee raha hai</p>